{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revenge of The Gamer is a game that will show you a modern gaming company from the inside. Incompetent developers, bad games, lack of optimization and all the gloom of the gaming industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1750504690\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revenge of The Gamer is a third-person slasher that shows the gaming industry from the inside out. Take down bad developers and get to the boss of the game company. You will visit many places that were previously inaccessible to regular players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your sword and embark on a journey filled with lots of fights and references. Your mission is to end the tyranny of the big game companies and make games better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every player is important to us. That's what the big gaming companies say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But what's the reality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is developed by one person and is under active development. You can suggest your idea in the feedback or in Steam discussions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Revenge of The Gamer!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789250?t=1750504690","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/c4b6d2126ae9b16007aa1249dbae2bb28d9e62a0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750504690","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/78d7c477957aa615da2e070311ccc0548036eb7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750504690","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/78d7c477957aa615da2e070311ccc0548036eb7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750504690","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3802860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revenge of The Gamer is a game that will show you a modern gaming company from the inside. Incompetent developers, bad games, lack of optimization and all the gloom of the gaming industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789250/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1750504690\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revenge of The Gamer is a third-person slasher that shows the gaming industry from the inside out. Take down bad developers and get to the boss of the game company. You will visit many places that were previously inaccessible to regular players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your sword and embark on a journey filled with lots of fights and references. Your mission is to end the tyranny of the big game companies and make games better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every player is important to us. That's what the big gaming companies say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But what's the reality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is developed by one person and is under active development. You can suggest your idea in the feedback or in Steam discussions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Revenge of The Gamer!</p>","developers":["Spirit"],"genres":[{"descri